---
layout: layouts/page.njk
title: Articles
eyebrow: Reading
permalink: /articles/
description: "Long reads on Rastafari history, practice and current debates."
---
<div class="article-list">
{%- for a in collections.articles %}
<a class="article-card" href="{{ a.url }}"><span class="meta">{{ a.date | dateNice }}{% if a.data.topic %} · {{ a.data.topic }}{% endif %}</span><b>{{ a.data.title }}</b><span>{{ a.data.summary }}</span></a>
{%- else %}
<p>No articles yet.</p>
{%- endfor %}
</div>
